    authoring, make tables import-only), make born-in-editor feed the SAME operation/patch model (FR-09) with NO
    separate full-render byte-author path remaining. This is a prerequisite for Success Criterion 7 (one
    byte-author, I-5) + task 060.
  </prompt>
